    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/016d32b126b28aa2546b58241c69afa9.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=69 /></span>After a biological disaster, the world is overrun by deadly creatures. As survivors, we\u2019ve taken refuge in an abandoned garage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, we picked up a radio signal: they\u2019re safe and self-sufficient. The only way to reach them is through a radio tower on the far side of the state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the outside is dangerous. Only the creature in the garage protects us \u2014 as long as we feed it every night. To reach the tower, we must gather fuel, feed the beast, and survive one more night. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/e3d94f06207ce75a539d37c9bdc33fc3.poster.avif?t=1751182921\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/e3d94f06207ce75a539d37c9bdc33fc3.webm?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/e3d94f06207ce75a539d37c9bdc33fc3.mp4?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4d3d4d1eccde85244900d8b9d96c2109.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is swarming with mutated creatures\u2014every step is a risk, every shadow a threat. <br>In this world, surviving alone is hard. <br>But together... together, we stand a chance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.poster.avif?t=1751182921\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.webm?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.mp4?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/08d414dc21b0aa95d26743a9f89ec0db.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate via voice chat in the game online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Horror Looter</i>, <i>First Person</i>, <i>Co-Op Survival</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gathered materials to craft useful items like spears, shotguns, and healing bandages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, or with friends (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the radio tower \u2014 no matter what it takes. It\u2019s your only way to the safe zone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6e3da140fc808039918a7e5349ef3b18.poster.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6e3da140fc808039918a7e5349ef3b18.webm?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6e3da140fc808039918a7e5349ef3b18.mp4?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/016d32b126b28aa2546b58241c69afa9.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=69 /></span>After a biological disaster, the world is overrun by deadly creatures. As survivors, we\u2019ve taken refuge in an abandoned garage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, we picked up a radio signal: they\u2019re safe and self-sufficient. The only way to reach them is through a radio tower on the far side of the state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the outside is dangerous. Only the creature in the garage protects us \u2014 as long as we feed it every night. To reach the tower, we must gather fuel, feed the beast, and survive one more night. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/e3d94f06207ce75a539d37c9bdc33fc3.poster.avif?t=1751182921\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/e3d94f06207ce75a539d37c9bdc33fc3.webm?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/e3d94f06207ce75a539d37c9bdc33fc3.mp4?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4d3d4d1eccde85244900d8b9d96c2109.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surface is swarming with mutated creatures\u2014every step is a risk, every shadow a threat. <br>In this world, surviving alone is hard. <br>But together... together, we stand a chance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.poster.avif?t=1751182921\" width=570 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.webm?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/4df508ccecbaeda2df84d221980d7c03.mp4?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/08d414dc21b0aa95d26743a9f89ec0db.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Communicate via voice chat in the game online.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Horror Looter</i>, <i>First Person</i>, <i>Co-Op Survival</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use gathered materials to craft useful items like spears, shotguns, and healing bandages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face enemies with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, or with friends (up to 4 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the radio tower \u2014 no matter what it takes. It\u2019s your only way to the safe zone</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6e3da140fc808039918a7e5349ef3b18.poster.avif?t=1751182921\" width=616 height=68 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6e3da140fc808039918a7e5349ef3b18.webm?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553250/extras/6e3da140fc808039918a7e5349ef3b18.mp4?t=1751182921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
